{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "viepropchain-utility-final-v3",
    "name": "ViePropChain - Utility-First (Final v3 - Secure Data)",
    "description": "🚀 **UTILITY-FIRST & SECURE DATA FLOW**\n\n**🔒 Security Logic:**\n- **Ảnh nhà:** Upload lên IPFS (Public) -> Hiển thị trên Frontend.\n- **Sổ đỏ/CCCD:** Upload lên Private Server (Secure) -> Chỉ Admin thấy.\n\n**🔄 Workflow:**\n1. Login Gmail (GET /api/auth/google) → Browser redirect → Copy JWT token.\n2. Get My Info (GET /api/auth/me) → Lấy custodialWallet.\n3. Upload Ảnh (Public) & Giấy tờ (Private).\n4. Tạo BĐS (POST /api/admin/properties).\n5. Admin duyệt (POST /api/admin/properties/:id/approve-and-mint).\n6. Khách thuê tạo đơn (POST /api/marketplace/orders/rent).\n7. Admin xác nhận payment → Sync Blockchain.\n\n**📍 Important:**\n- All requests go through API Gateway: `http://localhost:4000`\n- Authentication: Gmail OAuth → JWT token in Authorization header\n- Before testing: Run `node run.js` to start all services",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0️⃣ Authentication (Setup)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "🔐 Login Gmail (Landlord)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"landlord_token\", jsonData.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"landlord_user_id\", jsonData.user._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Landlord logged in: \" + jsonData.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Mở browser, đăng nhập Gmail, hệ thống redirect về với JWT token. Copy token vào `landlord_token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "🔐 Login Gmail (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"admin_token\", jsonData.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"admin_user_id\", jsonData.user._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Admin logged in: \" + jsonData.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Đăng nhập bằng tài khoản Admin Gmail. Copy token vào `admin_token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "🔐 Login Gmail (Renter)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"renter_token\", jsonData.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"renter_user_id\", jsonData.user._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Renter logged in: \" + jsonData.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Đăng nhập bằng tài khoản Renter Gmail. Copy token vào `renter_token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "👤 Get My Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{landlord_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Lấy thông tin user hiện tại từ JWT token. Response bao gồm email, walletAddress, custodialWallet."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"landlord_user_id\", jsonData.data.userId);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"landlord_email\", jsonData.data.email);",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.walletAddress) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"custodial_wallet_address\", jsonData.data.walletAddress);",
                  "        console.log(\"💼 Wallet Address: \" + jsonData.data.walletAddress);",
                  "    }",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ User Info: \" + jsonData.data.email);",
                  "    console.log(\"🆔 User ID: \" + jsonData.data.userId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📂 1. Upload Service (Split Strategy)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Upload Public Image (IPFS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data) {",
                  "    // Lưu CID và tạo URL IPFS",
                  "    var cid = jsonData.data.cid || jsonData.data.hash;",
                  "    var publicUrl = \"https://ipfs.io/ipfs/\" + cid;",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"public_image_url\", publicUrl);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"public_image_cid\", cid);",
                  "    console.log(\"🌍 Public Image CID: \" + cid);",
                  "    console.log(\"🌍 Public Image URL: \" + publicUrl);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{landlord_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Chọn ảnh nhà đẹp (Show cho khách xem)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ipfs/upload/image",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "ipfs", "upload", "image"]
            },
            "description": "Upload ảnh lên IPFS Service. Trả về CID và URL public."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Upload Legal Doc (Private Server)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data) {",
                  "    // Lưu CID và URL",
                  "    var cid = jsonData.data.cid || jsonData.data.hash;",
                  "    var privateUrl = \"https://ipfs.io/ipfs/\" + cid;",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"private_doc_url\", privateUrl);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"private_doc_cid\", cid);",
                  "    console.log(\"🔒 Private Doc CID: \" + cid);",
                  "    console.log(\"🔒 Private Doc URL: \" + privateUrl);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{landlord_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Chọn ảnh Sổ đỏ/CCCD"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ipfs/upload/document",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "ipfs", "upload", "document"]
            },
            "description": "Upload tài liệu lên IPFS Service (sổ đỏ, CCCD). Trả về CID và secure URL."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🏠 2. Property (Landlord & Guest)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3. Create Property (Submit Form)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"property_id\", jsonData.data._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Property Created: \" + jsonData.data._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{landlord_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Căn hộ Utility-First (Secure Demo)\",\n  \"description\": \"Chỉ hiển thị ảnh nhà, giấu sổ đỏ.\",\n  \"propertyType\": \"apartment\",\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"123 Xuan Thuy\",\n    \"ward\": \"Dich Vong\",\n    \"district\": \"Cau Giay\",\n    \"city\": \"Hanoi\",\n    \"country\": \"Vietnam\"\n  },\n  \"area\": 80,\n  \"bedrooms\": 2,\n  \"bathrooms\": 2,\n  \"price\": 1500000000,\n  \"currency\": \"VND\",\n  \"features\": [\"Balcony\", \"Parking\", \"Gym\", \"Swimming Pool\"],\n  \"legalStatus\": \"Red Book (So Do)\",\n  \"images\": [\n    \"{{public_image_url}}\" \n  ],\n  \"legalDocuments\": [\n    \"{{private_doc_url}}\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "properties"]
            },
            "description": "Gửi cả 2 loại link lên. Backend sẽ lưu `legalDocuments` với cờ `select: false`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Get Property Detail (Guest View)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Guest should NOT see legal docs\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.legalDocuments).to.be.undefined;",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.images).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "properties", "{{property_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "API Public. Kiểm tra xem trường `legalDocuments` có bị ẩn không (Nên bị ẩn)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👮 3. Admin Verification (See All)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5. Get Pending Properties",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties?verificationStatus=pending",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "properties"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "verificationStatus",
                  "value": "pending"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lấy danh sách BĐS đang chờ duyệt (verificationStatus = pending)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"property_id\", jsonData.data[0]._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"📋 Found pending property: \" + jsonData.data[0]._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Get Property Detail (Admin View)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Admin MUST see legal docs\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.legalDocuments).to.exist;",
                  "    console.log(\"🕵️ Admin checking docs: \" + jsonData.data.legalDocuments);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "properties", "{{property_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "API riêng cho Admin, có `select('+legalDocuments')` trong code backend."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Approve Only (No Mint)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"note\": \"Giấy tờ hợp lệ, chưa cần NFT.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}/approve",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "properties",
                "{{property_id}}",
                "approve"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin duyệt BĐS nhưng KHÔNG mint NFT. verificationStatus = verified, blockchainStatus = none."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Approve & Mint NFT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if(jsonData.success){",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token_id\", jsonData.data.nft.tokenId);",
                  "    console.log(\"🚀 Minted Token: \" + jsonData.data.nft.tokenId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"recipientWallet\": \"{{custodial_wallet_address}}\",\n    \"note\": \"Docs verified ok.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}/approve-and-mint",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "properties",
                "{{property_id}}",
                "approve-and-mint"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin duyệt -> Hệ thống Mint NFT. Lưu ý: Metadata của NFT chỉ chứa `publicImages`, KHÔNG chứa `legalDocuments`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Reject Property",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"reason\": \"Giấy tờ không rõ ràng, cần bổ sung.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}/reject",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "properties",
                "{{property_id}}",
                "reject"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Từ chối BĐS. verificationStatus = rejected."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Request More Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"message\": \"Cần bổ sung ảnh mặt sau sổ đỏ.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/properties/{{property_id}}/request-info",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "properties",
                "{{property_id}}",
                "request-info"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Yêu cầu bổ sung thông tin. verificationStatus = info_required."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🛒 4. Marketplace (Hybrid Orders)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "11. Create Rent Order (Fiat)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"order_id\", jsonData.data.orderId);",
                  "    console.log(\"📦 Order Created: \" + jsonData.data.orderId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{renter_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"propertyId\": \"{{property_id}}\",\n    \"days\": 365,\n    \"paymentMethod\": \"bank_transfer\",\n    \"amount\": 180000000\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/marketplace/orders/rent",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "marketplace", "orders", "rent"]
            },
            "description": "Người thuê tạo đơn thuê, thanh toán bằng chuyển khoản. status = pending_payment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "12. Create Buy Order (Cash)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"buy_order_id\", jsonData.data.orderId);",
                  "    console.log(\"💰 Buy Order: \" + jsonData.data.orderId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{renter_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"propertyId\": \"{{property_id}}\",\n    \"paymentMethod\": \"cash\",\n    \"amount\": 5000000000\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/marketplace/orders/buy",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "marketplace", "orders", "buy"]
            },
            "description": "Mua BĐS bằng tiền mặt. status = pending_payment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "13. Get Order Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{renter_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/marketplace/orders/{{order_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "marketplace", "orders", "{{order_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Xem chi tiết đơn hàng, bao gồm trạng thái blockchain sync."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "14. Confirm Payment (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"proofImage\": \"{{public_image_url}}\",\n    \"bankRef\": \"FT123456789\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/marketplace/orders/{{order_id}}/confirm-payment",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "marketplace",
                "orders",
                "{{order_id}}",
                "confirm-payment"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin xác nhận đã nhận tiền. Hệ thống tự động sync blockchain (gọi setUser). status = blockchain_syncing."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "15. Get Pending Orders (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/marketplace/orders/pending/all",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "marketplace", "orders", "pending", "all"]
            },
            "description": "Lấy danh sách đơn hàng đang chờ xác nhận thanh toán."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"order_id\", jsonData.data[0].orderId);",
                  "    console.log(\"📋 Pending Order: \" + jsonData.data[0].orderId);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "16. Retry Blockchain Sync",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
